// ---- Spawn Vehicles ----
//Instructions;-
//1. Set Vehicle ID of Spawn Vehicle xxxx cheat: e.g. "24040|1B0" == Tank || users can use the old long btn combos to spawn any vehicle.
//2. Press R1 + R2 to Enable vehicle spawns || we wrap the spawn xxx vehicle cheat activated function into a joker command.
//3. Press any button x 2 times  to spawn vehicle e.g. square, square. || no longer need to press the long btn combos
//4. Press L1 + L2 to Disable vehicle spawns || put the values back to normal to prevent constantly spawning vehicles on 2 x btn presses.
